:: Vault [sugarcast] {"title":"03 / Vault"}
<<widget "meter">>HP: <<print _args[0]>> / <<print _args[1]>><</widget>>

# Vault

A faceless warden blocks the way. Its armor is made from unfinished sentences.

<<meter $enemy.hp $enemy.maxHp>>

<<include "EnemyCard" {enemy: $enemy}>>

<<if not $hasKey>>
You have no key. The warden will not answer.
<<else>>
<<if $enemy.hp > 0>>
<<button "Speak a forgotten name">>
  <<set $enemy.hp -= 1>>
  <<set $insight += 1>>
  <<set $log.push({id: $log.length, text: "The Page Warden recovered a memory."})>>
<</button>>
<<else>>
::: dialogue {speaker="Warden" mood="relieved"}
“Thank you. I was not here to stop you. I was waiting for you.”
:::

[[Read the traveler's notes->FieldNotes]]
<</if>>
<</if>>

[[Return to the entrance->Start]]
